    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I integrated my own model into the package. Everything works well except for the plot function. I want to plot the posterior distribution of the hyper parameter, but when I run plot(&quot;the hBayesDM object of my model I got&quot;) it shows:</div><div><br></div><div><div>Error in plot_aversivelearning_delta(obj = x, fontSize = , ncols = , binSize = ) : </div><div>  could not find function &quot;plot_aversivelearning_delta&quot;</div></div><div><br></div><div>Could you think of any causes for this error?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank for your time in advance!</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards,</div><div>Lili</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
